+The yoloctl fork's StartAgent `workspace_read_only` option requires an explicit
+normalized workdir. It preserves no-follow component opens and effective-identity
+traversal checks while skipping only the final write probe. An explicit
+`/sandbox` receives structural checks too. False or absent preserves the original
